ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nChen Xiang, Wang Na, and Li Ming form a small team, and they prepare for this semester's subject research project. One day, Chen Xiang sees Wang Na and Li Ming in a meeting, Chen Xiang does not go to disturb them, he just quietly observes at the door, he notices that the atmosphere is a bit wrong. Wang Na keeps waving to Li Ming to look at a document, but Li Ming focuses more on his own work. After seeing all this, Chen Xiang walks into the room, picks up the document, and gently places it on Li Ming's desk. Chen Xiang and Wang Na exchange a few words, then start to talk with Li Ming. Wang Na and Li Ming both look at the document, then they start to discuss this issue carefully.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Wang Na feel after Jack does this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Na feels anxious and disappointed.\nB. Wang Na feels sad and depressed.\nC. Wang Na feels relieved and encouraged.\nD. Wang Na feels happy and satisfied.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249859308376256,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1f1d6006945d2800edd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367985073,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ac25ccf7f6c848d38a0cf0599432fb4c"}